1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,620
San Mateo, Kapitulo 24

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:07,300
Rimuwar ni Jesus iti templo,

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:11,860
Nakaadayo basitin idim masideg kinkwana dagiti adalan,

4
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:15,760
Kit intududa kinkwana dagiti pasdek iti templo.

5
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,460
Kino nana kadakwada?

6
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:21,720
Uen, makitayo amin dagito ita.

7
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,920
Ngyam ibagak kada kayo,

8
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:28,320
Nga awan to ti uray may saabato dito'y amabati itiyan na.

9
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,780
Marbantu amin.

10
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:42,000
Ibagam man kada kami nukaanon to amapasamak dagito'y.

11
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:49,320
Anyan to ti mapasamak amang ipakita iti iaay mo kain itipanong palantilubong.

12
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,800
Agannad kayo,

13
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,400
Kat di kay paalilaw.

14
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,300
Adon to ti umay,

15
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:01,540
Kat aramaten dan to tinagan ko akon-kunada.

16
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:03,820
Siak ti Kristo.

17
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:06,340
Kat adon to ti alilawenda.

18
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,560
Mang ngagyon to ti arimbangaw dagiti agdadangadang

19
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:14,320
Kendamdamag maipapan kada gitida dumapay agubgubat.

20
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:16,320
Ngyam di kayagdanag.

21
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:20,200
Masapol amapasamak dagito'y.

22
00:01:20,980 --> 00:01:22,480
Ngyam di na kayat asawen,

23
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,200
Adimtengan tipanong palan.

24
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:28,160
Agugubat to dagiti nasyon.

25
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:31,540
Agri rin na uto dagiti pagaryan.

26
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,360
Adan to bisin,

27
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:36,220
Kan genganed iti amin alugar.

28
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,980
Pang rugyan lang amin dagito'y,

29
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:42,240
Tipanagsagaba akas itipanang rugi,

30
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:44,600
Tipanagsagaba ti agpasngay.

31
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,080
Matiliw,

32
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,740
Kan mayawat kayo amadusa.

33
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,060
Mapapatay kayto.

34
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:55,680
Guraan da kayto dagiti amin at at tao gapukanya.

35
00:01:56,820 --> 00:01:57,940
Itiday ta tiyempo,

36
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:01,820
Adon to dagiti mang talikod itipan matida.

37
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,760
Aglilinipot,

38
00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:05,760
Ken agiginura danto.

39
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:09,420
Tumaod to dagiti ado asinant profeta,

40
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Amangyawawan,

41
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,260
Kadagiti ado at at tao.

42
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:16,940
Kastan to tipanagsaknap ti kinadakes.

43
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,880
Ket ti ayat dagiti ado at at tao,

44
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:21,440
Lumamiisto.

45
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:26,120
Ngyem maisalakan to tisya sinuman amakaib to.

46
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,540
Aging ga,

47
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:29,140
Itipanong palan.

48
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:34,380
May kas kasabanto itiintero alubong daytoy na imbag adamag.

49
00:02:35,140 --> 00:02:36,840
May papam itipagaryan.

50
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:40,260
Kas pamanagnag itisang katawan.

51
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,880
Kalpasan na,

52
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,700
Umayton tipanong palan.

53
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:45,540
Itikasta,

54
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:52,480
Inton makitayo tinakabotboteng amang dadael nga agtakdar itinasantuan alugar,

55
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,180
Akas insaun ni profeta Daniel,

56
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,220
Maawatan kuma,

57
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:59,580
Tiyagbasa tika ipapanandaytoy.

58
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:04,860
Masapol akumamang dagiti adda ijay hudeya kadagiti bambantay.

59
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:09,000
Umulog a dagus tiadda itituktok tibalay,

60
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:12,060
Ket saanin asumrek itibalay na,

61
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:16,440
Tap numangala itiurayan niya amabalin na nga itugot.

62
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,980
Tiadda ititaltalon,

63
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:23,120
Saanin nga gawid amangala itikagay na,

64
00:03:23,860 --> 00:03:24,900
Kadagitangal daw,

65
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:26,900
Kakaasinto dagitikagay,

66
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:29,180
Itimasikog ken dagiti ina,

67
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:31,740
Adipay napusot dagitian nakda.

68
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,300
Dawatin nyo iti Diyos,

69
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:37,400
Asaan kuma nga iti tsyempo tinapnap,

70
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:39,720
Wen no aldaw apanaginana,

71
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:41,180
Tipanagpak niyo.

72
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:43,480
Ta kadagitangal daw,

73
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:47,080
Nakarkaruntong nga adayo tirigat,

74
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,740
Ngam itianyaman anapasama,

75
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,620
Manipod pannakaparswa tilubong,

76
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:55,080
Aging ga kadagitoy nga aldaw.

77
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,080
Ket uray kaano,

78
00:03:57,080 --> 00:04:00,080
Awanton ti kastoy amapasamak.

79
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:05,080
Ngam kinisayan ti Diyos ti bilang dagitan nga aldaw.

80
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,080
Tano saan?

81
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,080
Awan ti makalasat.

82
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:12,080
Ngam gapo ka dagiti pinili na ata't tao,

83
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:16,080
Kisayan na ti bilang dagitan nga aldaw.

84
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:20,080
Daytoy ti gapo na anuadag ko na,

85
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:22,080
Kitaan nyo,

86
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:24,080
Adaditoy ni Kristo,

87
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:27,080
Wen no adasadyay,

88
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:29,080
Diyo patpatchen.

89
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:32,080
Taag parang to dagiti sinan Kristo,

90
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:35,080
Ken dagiti sinan Profeta.

91
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:38,080
Ket agipakita dan to kadagiti datdatlag,

92
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:41,080
Ken nakaskasdaaw abanag,

93
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:43,080
Tap nunumabalin,

94
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,080
Yaw awanda,

95
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:47,080
Uray dagiti pinili ti Diyos.

96
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:49,080
Denggan nyo,

97
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:52,080
Impakaamukon kada kayo dagitoy,

98
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:55,080
Sakbay ang mapasamagda.

99
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:58,080
Wen no nukunada,

100
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,080
Kitaan nyo,

101
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:02,080
Adda itilatang,

102
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:05,080
Di kay mapapansadyay.

103
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:07,080
Ket nukunada,

104
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,080
Kitaan nyo,

105
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:11,080
Adda nga aglimlimbang ditoy,

106
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:13,080
Diyo patpatchen.

107
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:16,080
Tao may to ti anak ti tao,

108
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:18,080
Akas iti kapardas ti kamat,

109
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:21,080
Nga aggilap iti daya nga agpalaod.

110
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:25,080
Sa dinuman ayan ti bangkay,

111
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:29,080
Sadyay to ti pag-uurnungan dagiti agila,

112
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:33,080
Apaman amalpas dagita arigrigat,

113
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:36,080
Agsip nga to ti init,

114
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:39,080
Din to agranyag ti bulan,

115
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:42,080
Ag tinag to dagiti bitwen,

116
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:47,080
Ket mawarawaran to dagiti pannakabalin iti tangatang,

117
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:50,080
Agparang to ijay langit ti pagilasinan,

118
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:53,080
Iti yaay ti anak ti tao.

119
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:58,080
Ket agdungaw to dagiti amin at at tao ditoy daga,

120
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:03,080
Inton makita da ti anak ti tao iti rabaw dagiti ulap ti langit,

121
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:06,080
Nga umay anap nuan pannakabalin,

122
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:09,080
Ken na indaklan adayag.

123
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:12,080
Agunin to ti dakkal at trompeta,

124
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:16,080
Ket ibaon to ti anak ti tao dagiti angheles na,

125
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:19,080
Kadagiti upat asuli ti lubong,

126
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:25,080
Sa danto ornungan dagiti tattao apinili ti Diyos,

127
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:28,080
Manipod iti may saapong to ti daga,

128
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:30,080
Agingga iti sabali.

129
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:35,080
Adalinyo ti surusuro ama adaw iti kayo nga igos,

130
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,080
No agugot,

131
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:40,080
Ket aggrusingan dagiti bulong nga,

132
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:44,080
Amuyo nga agbaliwen ti panawen.

133
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:48,080
Kastamet nga inton makita yo amin dagitoy,

134
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:51,080
Amuyo nga sidagan ti tsempo,

135
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:54,080
Ket dandanin mang rugi.

136
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:57,080
Laglagi po nyo ama pasamag to amin dagitoy,

137
00:06:57,080 --> 00:07:03,080
Sakbay ama tay amin at at tao iti daytoy akaputotan.

138
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:06,080
Mapukaw to ti langit ken ti daga,

139
00:07:06,080 --> 00:07:11,080
Ngam pulos, adin to mapukaw dagiti sa'o,

140
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:16,080
Ngam numaipapan iti idadateng daytang aldaw ken oras,

141
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:19,080
Awan ti makaam mo.

142
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:22,080
Uray dagiti angheles sa di langit,

143
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:24,080
Wen no ti anak.

144
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:27,080
Tilaang ama ti makaam mo.

145
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:31,080
Kas iti napasamag iti tsempo ni Noe.

146
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:35,080
Kastantumet ti mapasamag inton umay ti anak ti tao.

147
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:37,080
Kas ka dagiti aldaw,

148
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:39,080
Sakbay ti layos,

149
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:41,080
Nang nangan,

150
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:44,080
Nagiinom ken nag-aasawa dagiti tat-tao,

151
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:48,080
Agingga iti isasarret ni Noe iti daong.

152
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:51,080
Di daan mo ti mapaspasamag,

153
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:55,080
Agingga idi umay ti layos anang yanod kadakwada amin.

154
00:07:55,080 --> 00:08:00,080
Kastantumet ti mapasamag inton umay ti anak ti tao.

155
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:02,080
Iti dayta atsempo,

156
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:07,080
Addan to dwa alalaki nga agtrab trabaho iti talon.

157
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:10,080
Maalan to ti maysa,

158
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:13,080
Ket mabatin to ti kadwana.

159
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:17,080
Addan to dwa ababae nga gilgiling.

160
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:20,080
Maalan to ti maysa,

161
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:23,080
Ket mabatin to ti kadwana.

162
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:25,080
Agsagana kayong arod,

163
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:29,080
Tasaan nyo nga amo ti aldaw ay aay ti apuyo.

164
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:32,080
Laglagi po nyo ano amo kuma ti ama ti familia,

165
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:36,080
No kaano ti aay ti mananakaw.

166
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,080
Siririing kuma,

167
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:42,080
Tap no saan aserkan ti mananakaw ti balay na.

168
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:46,080
Daito'y tigapuna ama sapol akanayon asisasagana kayo.

169
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:50,080
Ta umay to ti anak ti tao iti tsempo,

170
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:52,080
Adiyo ipagpagarok.

171
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:55,080
Siya sino nga rood ti mapagtalkan,

172
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:57,080
Kan masirib nga adipen.

173
00:08:57,080 --> 00:09:03,080
Iso ti insaad ti apuna amang imaton kadagay ti daduma nga adipen,

174
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:07,080
Tap no ikan na ida iti kanan iti umiso atsempo.

175
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:12,080
Nagasa't daita nga adipen numasangputan ti apuna,

176
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:15,080
Akasta ti araramidan na.

177
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:18,080
Huwen, ibagak ka da kayo.

178
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:21,080
Isaad to ti apu daito'y nga adipen,

179
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:25,080
Amangaywan iti amin asanikwana.

180
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:28,080
Ngam no iso kitdakes nga adipen,

181
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:31,080
Kunanan to itibagina.

182
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:34,080
Mabayag pa iti isasangpet ti apu.

183
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:38,080
Pangpangurin na dagiti pada nga adipen,

184
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:41,080
Sa makipangan ken makiinom kadagiti mamartek.

185
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:46,080
Sumangpet to ti apuna iti aldaw adina ipagpagarop,

186
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:49,080
Ken iti oras adina ammo.

187
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:53,080
Dusain to ti apuna itinadagsen,

188
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:58,080
Ket mairaman to itikinadaksang kasap dagiti aginsisingpet.

189
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:00,080
Sadyay,

190
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,080
Agsangit,

191
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,080
Ken agngaratnet to.

